<?xml version="1.0"?>
<alert xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:emergency:cap:1.2"><identifier>855536fb-a3b5-4721-9015-92cc1dd493dc</identifier><sender>PAGASA-DOST</sender><sent>2026-10-23T05:39:38+08:00</sent><status>Actual</status><msgType>Update</msgType><scope>Public</scope><references>PAGASA-DOST,f76a4287-260f-4215-9443-a19ea2494c55,2026-10-22T17:26:00+08:00</references><info><category>Met</category><event>General Flood Advisory (Moderate)</event><responseType>Monitor</responseType><urgency>Future</urgency><severity>Moderate</severity><certainty>Possible</certainty><expires>2026-10-23T17:39:38+08:00</expires><senderName>PAGASA-DOST</senderName><headline>General Flood Advisory</headline><description>Under present weather conditions, At 3:00 AM today, the center of the eye of Typhoon "ROSAL" {CHAMPI} was estimated based on all available data at 280 km East Northeast of Itbayat, Batanes (22.0&#xB0;N, 124.2&#xB0;E) with maximum sustained winds of 155 km/h near the center and gustiness of up to 190 km/h. It is moving Northwestward at 15 km/h.  
The 12-hour rainfall forecast is light to moderate rains and thunderstorms.  
WATERCOURSES LIKELY TO BE AFFECTED :  

 + **Cagayan** - Rivers and its tributaries particularly Linao, Lower Abulug, Lower Pamplona, Cabicungan, Aunugay, Baua, Palawig and Taboan.  
 + **Batanes** - All rivers and its tributaries  
</description><instruction>People living near the mountain slopes and in the low lying areas of the above mentioned river systems and the **Local Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Councils** concerned still advised to take necessary precautionary measures.</instruction><web>http://www.pagasa.dost.gov.ph/index.php/26-hydromet/1582-flood-forecast-terms-and-symbols</web><contact>PAGASA-DOST</contact><parameter><valueName>layer:Google:Region:0.1</valueName><value>Region 2 (Cagayan Valley)</value></parameter><area><areaDesc>Cagayan</areaDesc><polygon>17.544357360493,122.19383966217 17.517056105107,121.65297335526 17.6914035175,121.43922758427 17.841954038726,121.31119655133 18.119791968792,121.47173553313 18.313131842547,121.45234277396 18.530970939076,121.05220008975 18.447321817624,120.96087162877 18.579611337753,120.97239650866 18.624809479961,121.15592083304 18.363624153438,121.63075201141 18.284534693434,121.85460153117 18.289253702461,122.01171675271 18.387234603238,122.13363908777 18.380704328247,122.32193902704 18.219594107103,122.30573714349 18.114464382048,122.18206624985 17.79380440239,122.14256584761 17.544357360493,122.19383966217</polygon><geocode><valueName>SAME</valueName><value>021500000</value></geocode></area><area><areaDesc>Batanes</areaDesc><polygon>20.482878224317,122.02360572053 20.452643576969,122.02629775526 20.408589155683,121.96347148931 20.366095173456,121.97386873411 20.348038630495,121.91849970251 20.404843493649,121.92863582449 20.488478973437,122.00314244964 20.482878224317,122.02360572053</polygon><geocode><valueName>SAME</valueName><value>020900000</value></geocode></area></info><Signature xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/09/xmldsig#"><SignedInfo><CanonicalizationMethod Algorithm="http://www.w3.org/TR/2001/REC-xml-c14n-20010315"/><SignatureMethod Algorithm="http://www.w3.org/2000/09/xmldsig#rsa-sha1"/><Reference URI=""><Transforms><Transform Algorithm="http://www.w3.org/2000/09/xmldsig#enveloped-signature"/></Transforms><DigestMethod A